cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Mathematics of Music — machine-checked notes & Lean library"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it. Each released note also carries its own Zenodo DOI; prefer the specific note's DOI."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Marín"
    given-names: "Carles"
    email: "karlesmarin@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
abstract: >-
  Machine-checked results in mathematical music theory: focused research notes
  backed by Lean 4 / Mathlib formalizations and reproducible Sage/GAP witnesses.
  Symbolic proofs use ordinary foundational axioms; finite census results also
  use compiled evaluation. The scope and unfinished generalizations are stated
  explicitly. Prepared with the assistance of an AI system.
keywords:
  - mathematical music theory
  - pitch-class set theory
  - neo-Riemannian theory
  - Lean 4
  - formalization of mathematics
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/karlesmarin/music-math"
url: "https://github.com/karlesmarin/music-math"
